[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; Dining table, laid: the plain "table" model (2x1 cells) with two place
; settings (a plate and a cup each), a small plant in the middle and a sauce
; bottle at the near edge, for dressing the dining room of the start map. Every
; child is a Kenney model used as-is; the whole prop is scaled by 2 at runtime
; (FurnitureDef.scale_mult), so the food-kit children sit at 0.35 = the game's
; own food size (0.7 world).
;
; Native kit units: the table is 0.841 x 0.327 x 0.447 and its top surface is at
; y = 0.327. Everything sits on that top, inside the table's own footprint, so
; the piece measures 2x1 cells after the x2 scale. The plant is a furniture-kit
; model at native scale (1.0) = the same 28 cm plant the catalog sells.

